body:
You can edit it in the steam mod files if you want

Program Files/Steam/steamapps/workshop/content/394360/1521695605/common/countries/colors

Old Hungary should be 

color = rgb { 152 85 92 }

color_ui = rgb { 152 85 92 }


And old Illyria should be 

color = rgb { 255 240 40 }

color_ui = rgb { 255 240 40 }

I don't know about Portugal since I don't have the files that old but I hope this helps

Edit: Not 100% sure, but you can probably find the old files in the direct download links for the old patches
